liquidData.description:
Liquid variable: Data. The primary workflow payload. Sub-objects: Data.Workflow (always available), Data.UIAction (UI-triggered only), Data.<ObjectName> (task outputs and input parameters).

Fields:
- Workflow: Always available. Fields: ExecutionDate (YYYY-MM-DD), ExecutionDateTime (YYYY-MM-DDTHH:MM:SS), ExecutionDateTimeUTC. Example: {{Data.Workflow.ExecutionDate}}
- UIAction: Available when workflow triggered from UI. Fields: ObjectId, ObjectName, ObjectNumber. Example: {{Data.UIAction.ObjectId}}
- TaskOutputs: Tasks write results to Data.<ObjectName> based on the task's 'object' parameter. Examples: Data.Account, Data.Subscription, Data.Invoice, Data.Callout. Array access: Data.Account[0].Id. Iteration: Data.Account[*].Name
- InputParameters: Workflow input fields appear as Data.<ObjectName>.<FieldName> based on workflow field configuration
